Test: Optional braces in if/else
--------------------------------------
  x is greater than 3 (no braces)
  y is not greater than 3 (no braces)
  z is between 5 and 15 (nested, no braces)
  After if (r < min) min = r, min = 0.5
  a is odd (no braces)
  b is positive
  (braces required for multiple statements)
